{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33007","headline":"下第寄知己 · 曹邺","name":"下第寄知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安孟春至，枯树花亦发。\n忧人此时心，冷若松上雪。\n自知才不堪，岂敢频泣血。\n所痛无罪者，明时屡遭刖。\n故山秋草多，一卷成古辙。\n夜来远心起，梦见潇湘月。\n大贤冠盖高，何事怜屑屑。\n不令伤弓鸟，日暮飞向越。\n闻知感激语，胸中如有物。\n举头望青天，白日头上没。\n归来通济里，开户山鼠出。\n中庭广寂寥，但见薇与蕨。\n无虑数尺躯，委作泉下骨。\n唯愁揽清镜，不见昨日髪。\n愿怜闺中女，晚嫁唯守节。\n勿惜四座言，女巧难自说。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}